  /// `qjs.wasm`, `sqlite3.wasm`, `lua.wasm` — do NOT (issue #640):
  /// JIT-compiling them at boot exhausted the Android `untrusted_app` VM
  /// limits (Rust PanicException → black screen). They are compiled on the
